[{"id":"MjMy-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai dari&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{2017X(2016^2-16)X2015}{2020X(2016^2-1)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2017X%282016%5E2-16%29X2015%7D%7B2020X%282016%5E2-1%29%7D\" />&nbsp;Adalah</p>","choices":["2012","2013","2014","2015<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4MA"},{"id":"MjMy-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\left \\lceil x \\right \\rceil\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleft%20%5Clceil%20x%20%5Cright%20%5Crceil\" />&nbsp;menyatakan bilangan bulat terkecil yang lebih besar daripada atau sama dengan jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"x= \\frac{2}{\\frac{1}{1001}+\\frac{2}{1002}\\frac{3}{1003}+...+\\frac{10}{1010}} ,maka \\left \\lceil x \\right \\rceil\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%3D%20%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1001%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B1002%7D%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B1003%7D&amp;plus;...&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B10%7D%7B1010%7D%7D%20%2Cmaka%20%5Cleft%20%5Clceil%20x%20%5Cright%20%5Crceil\" /></p>","choices":["35","36","37","38<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4MQ"},{"id":"MjMy-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"n!=n\\: (n-1)\\: (n-2)....2\\: \\: 1\\: \\: maka\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n%21%3Dn%5C%3A%20%28n-1%29%5C%3A%20%28n-2%29....2%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%201%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20maka\" /></p><p><img alt=\"1\\: . 1!+2\\: .2!+3.3!+....+(n-1).(n-1)!+n.n!=.....\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%5C%3A%20.%201%21&amp;plus;2%5C%3A%20.2%21&amp;plus;3.3%21&amp;plus;....&amp;plus;%28n-1%29.%28n-1%29%21&amp;plus;n.n%21%3D.....\" /></p>","choices":["(N-1)!+1","&nbsp;(N+1)!-1","&nbsp;(N+)!+1","n!+n"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4Mg"},{"id":"MjMy-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui ABCD dan CEGH adalah dua persegipanjang kongruen dengan panjang 17 cm, dan lebar 8 cm. Titik F adalah titik potong sisi AD dan EG. Luas segiempat EFDC adalah cm2.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200810142634.PNG\" style=\"height:150px; width:146px\" />","choices":["74,00","72,25&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;","68,00","63,75<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4Mw"},{"id":"MjMy-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui dua titik A(1,1) dan B (12,-1).Garis 1 dengan gradien&nbsp;<img alt=\"-\\frac{3}{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?-%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B4%7D\" />&nbsp;melalui titik B. Jarak antara titik A dan Garis 1 adalah....satuan panjang</p>","choices":["4","5","&nbsp;6","7"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4NA"},{"id":"MjMy-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan gambaran di samping Jika BE=2 cm , EF=6 cm, dan FC=4 cm, maka panjang DE adalah .....cm.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200810145216.PNG\" style=\"height:136px; width:203px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt%7B6%7D%7D%7B4%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt%7B6%7D%7D%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B%5Csqrt%7B3%7D%7D%7B4%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2%5Csqrt%7B3%7D%7D%7B3%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4NQ"},{"id":"MjMy-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada pagi hari yang cerah, suatu bola raksasa ditempatkan di tanah lapang yang datar. Panjang bayangan bola tersebut apabila diukur dari titik singgung bola dengan tanah adalah 15 m. Di samping bola tersebut terdapat tiang vertikal dengan tinggi 1 m yang mempunyai bayangan sepanjang 3 m. Radius bola tersebut adalah m.</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{10}+3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B15%7D%7B%5Csqrt%7B10%7D&amp;plus;3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{10}-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B15%7D%7B%5Csqrt%7B10%7D-3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{5}+2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B10%7D%7B%5Csqrt%7B5%7D&amp;plus;2%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{5}-2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B10%7D%7B%5Csqrt%7B5%7D-2%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4Ng"},{"id":"MjMy-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyak bilangan real x yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img alt=\"x^{2016}-x^{2014}=x^{2015}-x^{2013} adalah.....\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2016%7D-x%5E%7B2014%7D%3Dx%5E%7B2015%7D-x%5E%7B2013%7D%20adalah.....\" /></p>","choices":["0","1","2","3"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4Nw"},{"id":"MjMy-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika sistem persamaan&nbsp;</p><p>mx+3y=21</p><p>4x-3y=0</p><p>memiliki penyelesaian bilangan bulat x dan y, maka nilai m+x+y yang mungkin adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["9","10","11","12"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4OA"},{"id":"MjMy-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu survei dilakukan pada siswa kelas VII untuk mengetahui siswa yang berminat mengikuti kegiatan Paskibra. Hasil survei adalah sebagai berikut:<br /> &bull; 25% dari total siswa putra dan 50% dari total siswa putri ternyata berminat mengikuti kegiatan tersebut;<br /> &bull; 90% dari total peminat kegiatan Paskibra adalah siswa putri.<br /> Rasio total siswa putri dan total siswa putra kelas VII di sekolah tersebut adalah ....","choices":["9 : 1","9 : 2","9 : 3","9 : 4<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc4OQ"},{"id":"MjMy-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu fungsi ditentukan dengan rumus</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200810152557.PNG\" style=\"height:43px; width:190px\" /></p><p>Jika a adalah bilangan asli, maka nilai yang tidak mungkin untuk f(a) adalah ....","choices":["21","39","61","77<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc5MA"},{"id":"MjMy-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyak bilangan bulat k &gt; &ndash;20 sehingga parabola <img alt=\"y = x^2 + k \\: tidak \\: berpotongan \\: dengan\\: lingkaran\\: \\: x2 + y2 = 9\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?y%20%3D%20x%5E2%20&amp;plus;%20k%20%5C%3A%20tidak%20%5C%3A%20berpotongan%20%5C%3A%20dengan%5C%3A%20lingkaran%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20x2%20&amp;plus;%20y2%20%3D%209\" /> adalah ....","choices":["20","19","11","10<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc5MQ"},{"id":"MjMy-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu perusahaan menjual dua jenis produk A dan B. Rasio hasil penjualan produk A dan B dari tahun 2012 sampai dengan 2015 disajikan pada gambar berikut</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200810152833.PNG\" style=\"height:266px; width:416px\" /></p><p>Rata-rata banyak penjualan produk B dalam 4 tahun yang sama adalah ....","choices":["1000","1340","1350","1500<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc5Mg"},{"id":"MjMy-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di atas meja terdapat dua set kartu. Setiap set kartu terdiri atas 52 lembar dengan empat warna berbeda (merah, kuning, hijau, dan biru). Masing-masing warna terdiri atas 13 kartu bernomor 1 sampai dengan 13. Satu kartu akan diambil secara acak dari dua set kartu tersebut. Peluang terambil kartu berwarna merah atau bernomor 13 adalah ....","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{5}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B5%7D%7B13%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{8}{26}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B8%7D%7B26%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{19}{52}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B19%7D%7B52%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{31}{104}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B31%7D%7B104%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc5Mw"},{"id":"MjMy-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Terdapat lima bilangan bulat positif dengan rata-rata 40 dan jangkauan 10. Nilai maksimum &nbsp;yang mungkin untuk bilangan terbesar dari lima bilangan tersebut adalah ....","choices":["50","49","48","45<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/OTc5NA"}]
